## 14. MULTILINGUAL LANGUAGE SWITCHER

This is a core feature and must work across the entire website.

Provide a language selector in the desktop header and mobile menu.

Supported languages:

1. English.
2. Hindi — हिन्दी.
3. Hinglish — Romanized Hindi.
4. Rajasthani — optional, only if accurate translations can be provided.

Default language: English.

Hindi example:

English:
"BUILD STRENGTH. BECOME UNSTOPPABLE."

Hindi:
"ताकत बनाएं। अपनी सीमाओं से आगे बढ़ें।"

Hinglish:
