Use appropriate fonts and typography for Devanagari text.

Ensure Hindi text does not overflow buttons, cards, or navigation.

Use correct translations rather than simply changing a few headings.

For Rajasthani, only enable the selector if complete, reviewed translations are available. Otherwise, present it as a future language option or omit it.

